#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:5 ec5a82b3abce4793b0dc52df98fa2525
msgid "Calibration: Frame Type (Copters Only)"
msgstr "校准：机架类型（仅限多旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:7 645eb07508f84dbfad3622a990c29806
msgid ""
"This article explains how to select/calibrate your frame orientation in APM "
"Mission Planner 2 (copter-only). For other calibration tasks, see "
":ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 APM Mission Planner 2 中选择/校准机架方向（仅限多旋翼）。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 "
"<autopilot-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:12 a29fb46bc0fb4f1db825b337bd944e71
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:14 88105cb6708b4e79845c93602cb181bd
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:15 aa25e574105a4f7490f39b2572b5c9be
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot <install-firmware>`."
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中 <install-firmware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:16 d863764f5b2f44589601094995687dc9
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner and connected to Mavlink. "
"<connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner 并连接至 MAVLink。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:19 c253b111889a4351948dbd85924c8c5a
msgid "2 Select frame"
msgstr "2 选择机架"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:21 1f834120ea324856b1df8ab802af5fc7
msgid ""
"Select **Mandatory Hardware**, **Frame Type** and choose the correct diagram"
" to **select your vehicle configuration**."
msgstr "选择「Mandatory Hardware」、「Frame Type」，然后选择正确的图示以**选择您的飞行器配置**。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:28 2a6de8b7d0c64b75a72339c329c86da3
msgid "3 X and plus"
msgstr "3 X 型与十字型"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:30 35473641625c4213b7c401c9bfaf3fe4
msgid ""
"The default configuration is X. If you want one of the arms to serve as the "
"exclusive front-facing direction, select the Plus configuration. For "
"tricopters, traditional helis and Y6s, the frame type is ignored."
msgstr "默认配置为 X 型。如果希望某一机臂作为专用正前方向，请选择十字型（Plus）配置。对于三旋翼、传统直升机和 Y6，机架类型将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:35 76654ad3463b4d8cbebe562332f1f5dd
msgid "4 H frame"
msgstr "4 H 型机架"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:37 53b8404206f041439fdcb5b0a0e8c46d
msgid ""
"For an H-Frame quadcopter, use the option to set the frame type to ’3′ in "
"the Advanced Parameter Tab. To apply the H-frame configuration, swap the "
"left rear and right rear props and reverse the motor direction for each of "
"those motors (by swapping any two motor wires). Repeat the same process for "
"the front two motors."
msgstr ""
"对于 H 型四旋翼，请在高级参数选项卡中将机架类型参数设置为「3」。要应用 H "
"型机架配置，请交换左后和右后螺旋桨，并通过交换任意两根电机导线来反转这两个电机的转向。对前两个电机重复相同操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:44 2d1a525527164705959cbe0fccb73d26
msgid "5 V frame"
msgstr "5 V 型机架"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type.rst:46 f860fe181fe2460f8084ac8d435a38d7
msgid "Select the V frame for a quadcopter with wide-angled front arms."
msgstr "为前臂张角较大的四旋翼选择 V 型机架。"
